        "content": "<p>I don't think we have it yet. I'll be using the <code>TendstoCofinite</code> -&gt; <code>HasAntidiagonal</code> direction in my current work, but I can add the other direction while I'm at it</p>\n<p>update: I opened <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/41555\">#41555</a> connecting TendsotCofinite and HasAntidagonal</p>",
